In Bafsk, the Empire's {18:F3}
is being built. The townspeople have been made slaves
and are being worked to the bone.

It seems the Empire has a supply base
far to the north of {18:2F}. The {18:F3}
must be there by now.

The {18:ED} went in Cid's {18:F5}
to Castle Kashuon
to pick you up.

At last {18:2F} has returned to our hands.
The banner bearing the crest of the {18:F1}
has been raised over this land once more.
